<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>工作周总结与研究进展</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+Pro:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
        html, body { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
        body { 
            font-family: 'Source Serif Pro', Noto Serif SC, Georgia, serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #d9e2ec 100%);
        }
        .presentation-container { 
            width: 100%; height: 100%; position: relative; perspective: 1200px;
        }
        .slide-container {
            position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; top: 0; left: 0;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
            transform: translateX(100%) scale(0.95);
        }
        .slide-container.active {
            opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateX(0) scale(1); z-index: 10;
        }
        .slide-container.prev { transform: translateX(-100%) scale(0.95); }
        .slide {
            width: 95%; max-width: 1400px; height: 90%;
            background: white; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            padding: 60px 80px; overflow-y: auto; position: relative;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .slide { padding: 40px; width: 96%; }
        .slide-header {
            border-bottom: 3px solid #1e40af; padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .slide-title {
            font-size: clamp(28px); color: #1e3a5f; font-weight: 700;
        }
        .slide-cover {
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a5f, #0f172a); color: white;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .slide-cover::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -10%; width: 400px; height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .slide-cover h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px); z-index: 1; position: relative;
        }
        .slide-cover .slide-header { border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
        .highlight { background: #f0f7ff; padding: 24px 32px; border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; margin: 28px 0; }
        .highlight-warning { background: #fef3c7; border-left-color: #f59e0b; }
        .highlight-success { background: #dcfce7; border-left-color: #22c55e; }
        .highlight-danger { background: #fee2e2; border-left-color: #ef4444; }
        .highlight-info { background: #f0fdfa; border-left-color: #0d9488; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 30px 0; font-size: 18px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 16px 20px; text-align: left; }
        th { background: #1e40af; color: white; font-weight: 600; }
        tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f8fafc; }
        .nav-controls {
            position: fixed; bottom: 40px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 20px; z-index: 100;
        }
        .nav-btn {
            width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; border: none;
            background: #1e40af; color: white; font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(30,64,175,0.4); transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .nav-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(30,64,175,0.5); background: #1e3a8a; }
        .nav-btn:disabled { background: #cbd5e1; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
        .slide-progress {
            position: fixed; bottom: 120px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 8px; z-index: 100;
        }
        .dot {
            width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #cbd5e1; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .dot.active { background: #1e40af; transform: scale(1.3); }
        .slide-number {
            position: absolute; bottom: 30px; right: 50px; font-size: 16px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;
        }
        .two-col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
        @media (max-width: 900px) { .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
        .card { padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f0f4f8); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .card h4 { color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 22px; }
        svg { max-width: 100%; margin: 24px 0; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-controls { bottom: 20px; }
            .nav-btn { width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 20px; }
            .slide-progress { bottom: 90px; }
            .slide-number { right: 30px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) { .slide { padding: 24px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="presentation-container" id="presentation">
        <!-- Slide 1 -->
        <div class="slide-container active">
            <div class="slide slide-cover">
                <div style="z-index: 1; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 style="font-size: 42px;">工作周总结与研究进展</h1>
                    <div style="font-size: 22px; margin: 30px 0; color: #cbd5e1;">生成“人物玩手机”真实数据<br>与人脸马赛克修复</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 60px; color: #e2e8f0;">汇报人：[您的姓名]<br>日期：2026年5月</div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">1 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 2 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">工作概述与目标</h2></div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">核心目标</h3>
                <svg width="100%" height="140" viewBox="0 0 900 140">
                    <rect x="100" y="20" width="300" height="100" rx="12" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="250" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e40af" font-size="18" font-weight="600">目标1</text>
                    <text x="250" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="16">生成“人物玩手机”</text>
                    <text x="250" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="14">真实数据</text>
                    <rect x="500" y="20" width="300" height="100" rx="12" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="650" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#166534" font-size="18" font-weight="600">目标2</text>
                    <text x="650" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="16">解决人脸</text>
                    <text x="650" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="14">马赛克修复</text>
                </svg>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">工作流程</h3>
                <ul style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li>1. 问题发现：LoRA方案效果不达预期</li>
                    <li>2. 理论复盘：深入理解SD与AnomalyAny原理</li>
                    <li>3. 方向调整：测试不同基础模型</li>
                    <li>4. 系统实现：人脸修复任务</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="slide-number">2 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 3 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">问题发现：LoRA方案的局限性</h2></div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">初始方案</h3>
                <div class="highlight">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">用开源“玩手机”数据集对SD2.1做LoRA</p>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">结果</h3>
                <div class="highlight-danger">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">无论标准SD pipeline还是AnomalyAny</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">都无法达到想要的真实感效果！</p>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">现象</h3>
                <div class="highlight-warning">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">SD2.1始终带有动漫风格</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">3 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 4 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">理论复盘：SD整体架构</h2></div>
                <svg width="100%" height="280" viewBox="0 0 900 280">
                    <rect x="300" y="20" width="300" height="45" rx="8" fill="#1e40af"/>
                    <text x="450" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="16" font-weight="600">Prompt → Text Encoder</text>
                    <line x1="450" y1="65" x2="450" y2="85" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <rect x="200" y="85" width="500" height="55" rx="12" fill="#3b82f6"/>
                    <text x="450" y="118" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="16" font-weight="600">UNet：条件去噪网络</text>
                    <text x="450" y="136" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bfdbfe" font-size="12">Cross Attention注入文本条件</text>
                    <line x1="180" y1="85" x2="180" y2="110" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <rect x="80" y="110" width="200" height="40" rx="8" fill="#1e3a8a"/>
                    <text x="180" y="135" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14" font-weight="600">Random Noise / Latents</text>
                    <line x1="450" y1="140" x2="450" y2="160" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <rect x="250" y="160" width="400" height="50" rx="12" fill="#2563eb"/>
                    <text x="450" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="16" font-weight="600">VAE Decoder</text>
                    <line x1="450" y1="210" x2="450" y2="230" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <rect x="300" y="230" width="300" height="45" rx="8" fill="#1e40af"/>
                    <text x="450" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="16" font-weight="600">Final Image</text>
                </svg>
                <div class="highlight-info" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">关键：通过多次去噪从噪声生成图像</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">4 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 5 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">理论复盘：Text2Img</h2></div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">完整流程</h3>
                <svg width="100%" height="200" viewBox="0 0 900 200">
                    <rect x="50" y="20" width="160" height="45" rx="8" fill="#1e40af"/>
                    <text x="130" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14" font-weight="600">1. 文本编码</text>
                    <polygon points="215,43 245,33 245,53" fill="#1e40af"/>
                    <rect x="255" y="20" width="160" height="45" rx="8" fill="#3b82f6"/>
                    <text x="335" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14" font-weight="600">2. 随机噪声初始化</text>
                    <polygon points="420,43 450,33 450,53" fill="#3b82f6"/>
                    <rect x="460" y="20" width="160" height="45" rx="8" fill="#2563eb"/>
                    <text x="540" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14" font-weight="600">3. 去噪循环</text>
                    <polygon points="625,43 655,33 655,53" fill="#2563eb"/>
                    <rect x="665" y="20" width="160" height="45" rx="8" fill="#1e40af"/>
                    <text x="745" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14" font-weight="600">4. VAE解码</text>
                    <rect x="150" y="100" width="600" height="60" rx="12" fill="#f0f7ff" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="450" y="130" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e40af" font-size="15" font-weight="600">去噪循环：UNet预测噪声 → CFG引导 → Scheduler更新</text>
                    <text x="450" y="155" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="13">完全从零开始生成</text>
                </svg>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">CFG引导</h3>
                <div class="code-like" style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; background: #1e293b; color: #e2e8f0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px;">
                    噪声预测 = 无条件预测 + 引导强度 × (条件预测 - 无条件预测)
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">5 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 6 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">理论复盘：Img2Img & Inpainting</h2></div>
                <div class="two-col">
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4>Img2Img</h4>
                        <div class="highlight" style="margin-top: 16px;">
                            <p style="font-size: 16px;">原图 → VAE编码 → 加噪 → 去噪 → 输出</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 8px;">denoising_strength控制变化程度</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4>Inpainting</h4>
                        <div class="highlight-success" style="margin-top: 16px;">
                            <p style="font-size: 16px;">原图 + Mask → 只修改Mask区域</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 8px;">同步加噪边界平滑</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">Masked Noise Blending</h3>
                <svg width="100%" height="120" viewBox="0 0 900 120">
                    <rect x="200" y="20" width="500" height="80" rx="12" fill="#f0f7ff" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="450" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e40af" font-size="16" font-weight="600">latent = denoised × mask + noised_source × (1-mask)</text>
                    <text x="450" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="14">非Mask区域同步加噪，保证边界一致</text>
                </svg>
                <div class="slide-number">6 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 7 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">深入理解：AnomalyAny</h2></div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">在SD中的位置</h3>
                <svg width="100%" height="180" viewBox="0 0 900 180">
                    <rect x="50" y="20" width="800" height="140" rx="16" fill="#f0f7ff" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="450" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e40af" font-size="18" font-weight="600">在标准去噪之前插入优化层！</text>
                    <rect x="150" y="60" width="600" height="35" rx="8" fill="#3b82f6"/>
                    <text x="450" y="82" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14">1. 注意力损失 L_att → 关键词被关注</text>
                    <rect x="150" y="100" width="600" height="35" rx="8" fill="#60a5fa"/>
                    <text x="450" y="122" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="14">2. CLIP损失 L_img → 后期开启</text>
                    <text x="450" y="148" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="13">3. 梯度下降更新latent和文本embedding</text>
                </svg>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">核心</h3>
                <div class="highlight-warning">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">完全在latent空间优化，不改变预训练权重！</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">7 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 8 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">核心结论：模型上限问题</h2></div>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>方面</th>
                            <th>LoRA</th>
                            <th>AnomalyAny</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>本质</strong></td>
                            <td>训练（改变权重）</td>
                            <td>测试时优化</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>数据需求</strong></td>
                            <td>10-100张</td>
                            <td>0张（仅文本）</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>知识来源</strong></td>
                            <td>训练数据</td>
                            <td><strong style="color: #ef4444;">完全依赖预训练</strong></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="highlight-danger" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">结论</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">LoRA与AnomalyAny只是<strong>锦上添花</strong></p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">生成效果的上限完全取决于基础模型！</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">8 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 9 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">SD2.1的问题</h2></div>
                <svg width="100%" height="160" viewBox="0 0 900 160">
                    <rect x="100" y="20" width="700" height="120" rx="16" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="3"/>
                    <text x="450" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#991b1b" font-size="18" font-weight="600">训练数据LAION-5B中动漫/插画内容占比过高</text>
                    <text x="450" y="90" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7f1d1d" font-size="16">模型学到这个分布偏向 → 生成时自然偏向动漫风格</text>
                    <text x="450" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7f1d1d" font-size="14">无论怎么调整都无法从根本改变</text>
                </svg>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">方向验证</h3>
                <div class="highlight-success">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">改用原始text2img pipeline</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">测试Realistic Vision 1.5、SDXL、ZImage</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">效果都比SD2.1真实得多！</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">9 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 10 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">模型对比实验</h2></div>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr><th>模型</th><th>效果</th><th>动漫风程度</th></tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><strong>SD2.1</strong></td><td>高</td><td>高（问题严重）</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><strong>Realistic Vision 1.5</strong></td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>低</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><strong>SDXL</strong></td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>中等</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><strong>ZImage</strong></td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>低</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="highlight" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">结论：SD2.1确实不适合真实感任务</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">换更好的基础模型才是正解！</p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-number">10 / 14</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 11 -->
        <div class="slide-container">
            <div class="slide">
                <div class="slide-header"><h2 class="slide-title">人脸马赛克修复任务</h2></div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">任务背景</h3>
                <div class="highlight-warning">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">目标数据集中约70%人脸被打马赛克</p>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 30px 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 22px;">当前方案</h3>
                <svg width="100%" height="160" viewBox="0 0 900 160">
                    <rect x="30" y="20" width="250" height="100" rx="12" fill="#f0f7ff" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="155" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e40af" font-size="16" font-weight="600">马赛克检测</text>
                    <text x="155" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="14">统计连续灰色区域</text>
                    <text x="155" y="102" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="12">超阈值即判定为马赛克</text>
                    <polygon points="285,70 315,60 315,80" fill="#3b82f6"/>
                    <rect x="325" y="20" width="250" height="100" rx="12" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text x="450" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#92400e" font-size="16" font-weight="600">SD2.1 Inpainting</text>
                    <text x="450" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#78350f" font-size="14">用prompt修复人脸</text>
